00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:35,280
I didn't plan this, but we ended up talking about pretty much the top four things that I recommend people experiment with under paywalls.

231
00:18:35,600 --> 00:18:46,800
Because like, yeah, you can test like colors and change the color of the CTA button and all that kind of stuff, but like the highest impact or price testing and including in that the pricing and packaging.

232
00:18:46,960 --> 00:18:55,600
Like I did a test in my weather app of defaulting to only showing the $4 a month subscription versus showing the $40 a year subscription.

233
00:18:56,000 --> 00:19:00,640
And I had a 20% increase in conversion to paying by them just seeing.

234
00:19:01,040 --> 00:19:01,600
that four dollar.

235
00:19:02,080 --> 00:19:07,120
And so by experimenting with the packaging, I saw a 20% lift in conversion to paying.

